OL,3,GNEWSAMum and son to run in honour of
OL,4,A'inspiring' dad
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe wife and son of a rugby player who
OL,7,Fwas left paralysed from the chest down
OL,8,Fafter a tackle during a game will run
OL,9,Fthe Great North Run in his honour.
OL,11,FFormer Banbury Rugby Club captain and
OL,12,Fcoach John Baker was left dependent on
OL,13,Fa ventilator following the accident on
OL,14,F13 November 2024.
OL,16,FHis wife Tina and son Sean are taking
OL,17,Fon the popular half marathon to raise
OL,18,Ffunds for Spinal Research and awareness
OL,19,Fof the impact of a spinal cord injury.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
